### 📄 Code (HTML + JavaScript):

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Real-Time 3D Scene Viewer</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; overflow: hidden; }
