    loop(Listen).

handle(Socket) ->
    {ok, Data} = gen_tcp:recv(Socket, 0),
    gen_tcp:send(Socket, "HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\nContent-Length: 13\r\n\r\nHello, World!"),
    gen_tcp:close(Socket).
```

**Why Erlang?**  
Erlang is designed for fault tolerance and massive concurrency, using the BEAM VM. It’s ideal for systems requiring high availability and fault recovery.

